/docker/                            @cypher-gridpay/devops
/docker/**                          @cypher-gridpay/devops
Dockerfile                          @cypher-gridpay/devops
docker-compose*.yml                 @cypher-gridpay/devops
docker-compose*.yaml                @cypher-gridpay/devops

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Documentation
